の写真の髪型はどちらでも構いません。)\n\n茜の特徴として、頭の羽と角、後ろの羽があります。忘れずに描いてください。2.2.左目は紫、右目は赤です。\n\nこれも好きなように描いてください。この絵は私の個人的な使用となります。\n\nまた、この絵は私の個人的な使用とさせていただきます。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/kn6Zfk1", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@moemoepiano/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 505485, "client_id": 1852632, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=155894fdc458d38527ff4eba253c72d1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=155894fdc458d38527ff4eba253c72d1, https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c9ec24695f0c964ee3f77cd7906e844 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcebb12fd86eef0c25956d23022267af 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2cdbabcd332a012bc842e0832a924c0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2cdbabcd332a012bc842e0832a924c0, https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd0cd7538d73ad0070302c584a66dc20 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4cbb6ef/uploads/origins/eeb6b9d0-4c5b-4808-8e86-0a371e93a47c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b770bc40cbb2cc964f7905be7887bbd5 3x"}, "body": "Hello. I love your work! The amount of detail you put into eyes really caught my attention.\n\nCan you draw VTuber Iekushi Chapipi ( https://twitter.com/IekushiChapipi )?\n\nChapipi is a computer virus and a bit of a brat, but also gets flustered and embarrassed easily! She can also sing very well. She's very talented and tries to provide a lot of variety! This includes being cute sometimes, cool other times, and seductive when she wants to be.\n\nCan you draw Chapipi in an outfit / pose similar to the one referenced below?\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter References:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cz6MT87jRwLqZaC0_Xkww4AEprY8AIx1?usp=sharing\n\nOutfit / Pose reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1CJ6gkFVIlEW8lQbRxyZcXPn9R1VKD_-q/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@moemoepiano/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 505485, "client_id": 37270, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2f15033/uploads/origins/8ee224cb-1544-435e-924d-4d66f5dc45e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fd9d154ab760e9bcc8964075f4c6d9b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2f15033/uploads/origins/8ee224cb-1544-435e-924d-4d66f5dc45e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fd9d154ab760e9bcc8964075f4c6d9b, https://si.imgix.net/d2f15033/uploads/origins/8ee224cb-1544-435e-924d-4d66f5dc45e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18db0b0d2cdc20f3b1046bf51e4a1b8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2f15033/uploads/origins/8ee224cb-1544-435e-924d-4d66f5dc45e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&d